{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "动画用示例 1 演示双指针法：每次处理较矮的一侧，因为这一侧的蓄水上限已经由对应的历史最高柱确定。蓝色水格逐步出现，单格水量累加后得到总蓄水量 6；整个过程只需一次扫描和常数额外空间。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>trapping-rain-water</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\n.sub{text-align:left;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px}\n.chart{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,22px);gap:2px;align-items:end;height:120px;padding-top:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #3c3c3c}\n.column{height:100%;display:grid;grid-template-rows:repeat(3,1fr);position:relative}\n.column .cell{margin:0;border:none;border-radius:2px;min-height:0;width:auto}\n.bar{background:#555}\n.water{background:#0e639c}\n.pointer{position:absolute;top:-16px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);color:#3794ff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}\n.index,.height{font-size:10px;text-align:center;color:#8d8d8d;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.status{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:4px;margin-top:6px}\n.status .card{padding:6px 8px;text-align:center}\n.value{font-size:13px;color:#3794ff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:700}\n.explain{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}\n.total{color:#fff;background:#0e639c;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:11px}\n.legend{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px}\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>双指针收拢接雨水</h1>\n<p class=\"sub num\">height = [0,1,0,2,1,0,1,3,2,1,2,1]</p>\n<section class=\"panel\"><div id=\"chart\" class=\"chart\"></div>\n<div class=\"status\">\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">左最高</div><div id=\"lm\" class=\"value\">0</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">右最高</div><div id=\"rm\" class=\"value\">0</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">本次</div><div id=\"gain\" class=\"value\">0</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-label\">累计</div><div id=\"sum\" class=\"value\">0</div></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"explain\" class=\"explain\"></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span>灰=柱</span><span>蓝=水</span><span>高亮=当前</span></div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst h=[0,1,0,2,1,0,1,3,2,1,2,1],surface=[0,1,1,2,2,2,2,3,2,2,2,1];const steps=[{l:0,r:11,lm:0,rm:0,g:0,s:0,a:-1,seen:[],t:'左右指针从两端出发。较矮一侧决定本轮可以确定的位置。'},{l:1,r:11,lm:0,rm:0,g:0,s:0,a:0,seen:[0],t:'左柱高度 0 不高于右柱，更新左侧最高值，当前位置不接水。'},{l:2,r:11,lm:1,rm:0,g:0,s:0,a:1,seen:[0,1],t:'左侧最高值更新为 1，继续向中间移动。'},{l:3,r:11,lm:1,rm:0,g:1,s:1,a:2,seen:[0,1,2],t:'位置 2：左侧最高为 1，柱高为 0，接水 1 − 0 = 1。'},{l:3,r:10,lm:1,rm:1,g:0,s:1,a:11,seen:[0,1,2,11],t:'右侧更矮，先处理位置 11，并把右侧最高值更新为 1。'},{l:4,r:10,lm:2,rm:1,g:0,s:1,a:3,seen:[0,1,2,3,11],t:'位置 3 抬高左侧边界，左侧最高值更新为 2。'},{l:5,r:10,lm:2,rm:1,g:1,s:2,a:4,seen:[0,1,2,3,4,11],t:'位置 4：接水 2 − 1 = 1，累计水量变为 2。'},{l:6,r:10,lm:2,rm:1,g:2,s:4,a:5,seen:[0,1,2,3,4,5,11],t:'位置 5：接水 2 − 0 = 2，累计水量变为 4。'},{l:7,r:10,lm:2,rm:1,g:1,s:5,a:6,seen:[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,11],t:'位置 6：接水 2 − 1 = 1，累计水量变为 5。'},{l:7,r:9,lm:2,rm:2,g:0,s:5,a:10,seen:[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,10,11],t:'转向右侧：位置 10 将右侧最高值更新为 2。'},{l:7,r:8,lm:2,rm:2,g:1,s:6,a:9,seen:[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,9,10,11],t:'位置 9：接水 2 − 1 = 1，累计水量变为 6。'},{l:7,r:7,lm:2,rm:2,g:0,s:6,a:8,seen:[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,8,9,10,11],t:'位置 8 更新右侧边界。双指针相遇，计算完成：总水量为 6。'}];const chart=document.getElementById('chart');function draw(k){const x=steps[k];chart.innerHTML='';h.forEach((v,i)=>{const col=document.createElement('div');col.className='column'+(i===x.a?' active':'');for(let y=3;y>=1;y--){const c=document.createElement('div');c.className='cell';if(y<=v)c.classList.add('bar');else if(x.seen.includes(i)&&y<=surface[i])c.classList.add('water');col.appendChild(c)}if(i===x.l||i===x.r){const p=document.createElement('div');p.className='pointer';p.textContent=i===x.l&&i===x.r?'L = R':i===x.l?'L ↓':'R ↓';col.appendChild(p)}const idx=document.createElement('div');idx.className='index';idx.textContent=i;col.appendChild(idx);const ht=document.createElement('div');ht.className='height';ht.textContent='h='+v;col.appendChild(ht);chart.appendChild(col)});document.getElementById('lm').textContent=x.lm;document.getElementById('rm').textContent=x.rm;document.getElementById('gain').textContent='+'+x.g;document.getElementById('sum').textContent=x.s;document.getElementById('explain').innerHTML=x.t+' <span class=\\'total\\'>累计 '+x.s+'</span>'}let k=0;draw(k);setInterval(()=>{k=(k+1)%steps.length;draw(k)},1250);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(n)",
  "space_complexity": "O(1)",
  "complexity_note": "n 为柱子数量. 双指针每次处理较矮一侧, 维护左右最高值和累计水量; 每个位置最多处理一次."
}
